<title>UK: Tug to aid Liberian soya carrier off Madagascar.</title>
<headline>Tug to aid Liberian soya carrier off Madagascar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A tug is proceeding to assist the Liberian-flag bulk carrier Askania Nova south of Madagascar, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 52,450 dwt bulker, with a cargo of soya, is taking in water in the engine room and using its pumps.</p>
<p>The Askania Nova sailed Cape Town on July 20 for Yokohama.</p>
</text>
